          target="_blank"
        />
        <mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><strong><a href="https://fujiya.ae/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">Fujiya</a></strong> in Dubai Marina is a long-standing Japanese dining destination, known for bringing authentic Japanese flavours and traditional izakaya-style hospitality to the UAE. Holder of a 2025 Michelin Star and Asia's 50 Best recognition. Standout dishes include wagyu tiradito with yuzu ponzu and black cod miso-glazed with truffle. No alcohol, but premium sake and teas pair perfectly.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><strong><em>Pro tip:</em></strong><em> Opt for the omakase tasting menu to savor the chef's seasonal innovations; reserve well in advance for counter seats.</em></p>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-spacer height="10px"></mj-spacer>
