<!-- Summary / CTA -->
<mj-text padding="0px 12px 10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">EatClean, a healthy meal delivery company based in Dubai, is looking to hire an Operations Manager to oversee daily operations and support the company’s expanding retail partnerships. The role focuses on coordinating with outsourced kitchen and delivery partners, ensuring meal quality, managing production schedules, resolving operational issues, and monitoring food costs and performance metrics. Candidates should have 5-10 years of experience in restaurant, catering, cloud kitchen, or food operations, and experience managing vendors or partners. UAE experience is preferred.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><a href="https://dubai.dubizzle.com/jobs/restaurant-operations/2026/3/6/operations-manager-meal-delivery-business--2-099---30c6758358044ca092a47e6a97e0f183/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;"><strong>Register here  </strong></a></p>
</mj-text>
