        <mj-text
  padding="10px 12px"
  font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h2 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400; margin: 0;">
    Dubai missile threat alert
  </h2>
</mj-text>

<mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">The UAE Ministry of Interior issued an <a href="https://gulfnews.com/uae/uae-issues-emergency-alert-in-dubai-over-potential-missile-threat-1.500465306" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">emergency alert</a> across Dubai, urging people to immediately seek shelter following warnings of a potential missile threat. Authorities advised people to stay inside secure buildings and avoid windows and open areas. Authorities also called on residents to rely solely on official government channels for updates and further instructions as the situation develops.</p>
</mj-text>

<mj-divider
  border-style="dashed"
  border-width="1px"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px 4px 12px"
/>

<mj-text
  padding="10px 12px"
  font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h2 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400; margin: 0;">
    No photos of drone damage
  </h2>
</mj-text>

<mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">The UAE Attorney-General <a href="http://khaleejtimes.com/uae/uae-attorney-general-warns-sharing-videos-incident-sites?_refresh=true" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">warned residents</a> against photographing or sharing images and videos of damage caused by falling drone debris or projectiles. Authorities said such content could spread panic or misinformation. Authorities also cautioned against AI-generated or manipulated footage, stressing that violators may face legal action.</p>
</mj-text>

<mj-divider
  border-style="dashed"
  border-width="1px"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px 4px 12px"
/>

<mj-text
  padding="10px 12px"
  font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h2 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400; margin: 0;">
    Aid for stranded travellers
  </h2>
</mj-text>

<mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Pakistan Medical Center in Umm Hurair is offering stranded travellers<a href="https://www.khaleejtimes.com/uae/free-medical-support-for-uae-travellers-airspace-disruption" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;"> free consultations</a>, diagnostics, and essential medication amid ongoing airspace closures, covering 37 specialties daily. Supported by UAE authorities and volunteer doctors, the centre allocates a special fund for treatment. Thumbay Healthcare is providing urgent medical assistance, while Aster DM Healthcare offers free online mental health video consultations nationwide via the myAster app.</p>
</mj-text>
