          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Dubai issued nearly 1,600 new restaurant licences in 2025, More than any other city,  sign of just how aggressively the city’s food scene is expanding. It reflects rising demand from residents, tourists, and investors, and helps explain why Dubai now pitches itself as the region’s biggest and most influential gastronomy hub</p>
